  - elementId: bad1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [70, 264, 555, 264]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [7000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$badSoft"}
  - elementId: bad1-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [96, 282, 500, 26]
    content: {fontSize: 17, fontFamily: "MiSans", color: "$bad", wrap: false, align: [left, middle], text: <strong>🩹 致命伤 ①：每步丢弃私有推理</strong>}
  - elementId: bad1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [96, 318, 503, 196]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.65
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>模型能看到过去的动作记录，却无法继续使用产生这些动作时的<strong>内部推理状态</strong>：</p>
        <ul>
        <li>每一步都花大量 Token 重新解释游戏</li>
        <li>已验证的规律不能稳定复用</li>
        <li>策略在相邻动作间不连贯</li>
        <li>探索难以累计成长期知识</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: bad2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [655, 264, 555, 264]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [7000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$badSoft"}
  - elementId: bad2-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [681, 282, 500, 26]
    content: {fontSize: 17, fontFamily: "MiSans", color: "$bad", wrap: false, align: [left, middle], text: <strong>🩹 致命伤 ②：滚动截断早期历史</strong>}
  - elementId: bad2-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [681, 318, 503, 196]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.65
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>上下文超阈值后直接<strong>删除最早的动作和观察</strong>，模型逐渐失去"过去发生过什么"：</p>
        <ul>
        <li>不只是减少信息量</li>
        <li>更会破坏因果链——后期决策依赖很早的规则发现</li>
        <li>而这些记录已经不在上下文中</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: ana-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [70, 552, 1140, 88]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accentSoft"}
  - elementId: ana-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 552, 1080, 88]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.55
      align: [left, middle]
      text: <strong>🧩 打个比方：</strong>密室逃脱里，每解开一个机关就被要求忘掉刚才的推理过程（致命伤①）；笔记记满了就把最早的几页撕掉（致命伤②）。你的智商没变——但你永远走不出这个密室。
  - elementId: footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [70, 676, 1140, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [70, 686, 500, 20]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, align: [left, middle], text: 从 Chat API 到 Agent Runtime · 技术分享}
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1130, 686, 80, 20]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, align: [right, middle], text: "14"}
